\code{\link[=fipskg]{fipskg()}}
or \code{\link[=pqckg]{pqckg()}}; an invalid \code{prehash} or
\code{ctx} (from
\code{\link[=cpssign]{cpssign()}}); \code{attestation} not from
\code{cpsatst()}. A
signature that fails to verify is a failed row, not an error.
